{"id":"6b1eefe8ea8eb67a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/627_Coalition_Logic.md","title":"627 Coalition Logic","display":"627_Coalition_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n\">\\(X^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ag}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ag}\\)</span> 为非空有限主体集合。联盟集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Coal}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Ag}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Coal}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Ag}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子的类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\quad\n\\operatorname{coal}_C:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\quad\n\\operatorname{coal}_C:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n[C]A=\\operatorname{coal}_C(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n[C]A=\\operatorname{coal}_C(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\n\\langle C\\rangle A=\\neg[C]\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\n\\langle C\\rangle A=\\neg[C]\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[C]A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\([C]A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{627}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{627}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{627}([C]A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{627}([C]A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{627}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{627}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{627}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span> 为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{627}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{627}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{627}\n=\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}^{\\mathsf{Prop}}:\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{627}\n=\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}^{\\mathsf{Prop}}:\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{627}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{627}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{627}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{627}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{627}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{627}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 递归满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma([C]A)=[C]\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma([C]A)=[C]\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,627}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,627}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{627}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{627}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{627}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{627}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{627}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{627}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>联盟能力公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{627}\n=\n\\{\\neg[C]\\bot:C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{627}\n=\n\\{\\neg[C]\\bot:C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}^{627}\n=\n\\{[C]\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}^{627}\n=\n\\{[C]\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{627}\n=\n\\{\\neg[\\varnothing]\\neg A\\to[\\mathsf{Ag}]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{627}\n=\n\\{\\neg[\\varnothing]\\neg A\\to[\\mathsf{Ag}]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{627}\n=\n\\{[C](A\\land B)\\to[C]B:C\\in\\mathsf{Coal},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{627}\n=\n\\{[C](A\\land B)\\to[C]B:C\\in\\mathsf{Coal},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sup}^{627}\n=\n\\{([C]A\\land[D]B)\\to[C\\cup D](A\\land B):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Coal},\\ C\\cap D=\\varnothing,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sup}^{627}\n=\n\\{([C]A\\land[D]B)\\to[C\\cup D](A\\land B):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Coal},\\ C\\cap D=\\varnothing,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{627}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{627}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{627}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sup}^{627}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{627}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{627}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{627}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sup}^{627}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{627}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{627}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{627}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),[C]A\\leftrightarrow[C]B):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Coal},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{627}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),[C]A\\leftrightarrow[C]B):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Coal},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{627}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{627}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{627}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{627}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{627}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{A\\leftrightarrow B}{[C]A\\leftrightarrow[C]B}\\ (RE_C),\\quad C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{A\\leftrightarrow B}{[C]A\\leftrightarrow[C]B}\\ (RE_C),\\quad C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>-证明是序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m},\\qquad\nm\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\quad\n(\\Delta_i,A_i)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{627})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m},\\qquad\nm\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\quad\n(\\Delta_i,A_i)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{627})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且每行满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{627}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{627}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\)</span>，使\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=[C]A\\leftrightarrow[C]B\">\\(A_i=[C]A\\leftrightarrow[C]B\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{627}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{627}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的序列的集合，并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{627}(\\pi)=A_{m-1},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{627}(\\pi)=\\Delta_{m-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{627}(\\pi)=A_{m-1},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{627}(\\pi)=\\Delta_{m-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{627}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{627}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{627}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{627}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，使</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{627}(\\pi)=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{627}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{627}(\\pi)=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{627}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{627}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{627}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{627}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{627}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限证书关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{627}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{627}(\\Gamma),\n\\operatorname{last}_{627}(\\pi)=A,\n\\operatorname{dep}_{627}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{627}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{627}(\\Gamma),\n\\operatorname{last}_{627}(\\pi)=A,\n\\operatorname{dep}_{627}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-联盟博弈语义\">9. 联盟博弈语义</h1>\n<p>联盟博弈模型为五元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(S,\\mathsf{Act},d,\\operatorname{out},V),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(S,\\mathsf{Act},d,\\operatorname{out},V),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(S\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Act}\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Act}\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathsf{Ag}\\times S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Act})\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d:\\mathsf{Ag}\\times S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Act})\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S\">\\(s\\in S\\)</span> 定义完全行动剖面集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prof}_{\\mathcal M}(s)=\\prod_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}}d(a,s),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prof}_{\\mathcal M}(s)=\\prod_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}}d(a,s),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathcal M}=\\{(s,\\alpha):s\\in S,\\ \\alpha\\in\\mathsf{Prof}_{\\mathcal M}(s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{\\mathcal M}=\\{(s,\\alpha):s\\in S,\\ \\alpha\\in\\mathsf{Prof}_{\\mathcal M}(s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}:D_{\\mathcal M}\\to S\">\\(\\operatorname{out}:D_{\\mathcal M}\\to S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span>。明确地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CGS}_{627}\n=\n\\{\\mathcal M=(S,\\mathsf{Act},d,\\operatorname{out},V):\nS\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\mathsf{Act}\\ne\\varnothing,\nd:\\mathsf{Ag}\\times S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Act})\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\operatorname{out}:D_{\\mathcal M}\\to S,\nV:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CGS}_{627}\n=\n\\{\\mathcal M=(S,\\mathsf{Act},d,\\operatorname{out},V):\nS\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\mathsf{Act}\\ne\\varnothing,\nd:\\mathsf{Ag}\\times S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Act})\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\operatorname{out}:D_{\\mathcal M}\\to S,\nV:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Coal}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_C^{\\mathcal M}(s)=\\prod_{a\\in C}d(a,s),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_C^{\\mathcal M}(s)=\\prod_{a\\in C}d(a,s),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\varnothing}^{\\mathcal M}(s)=\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\varnothing}^{\\mathcal M}(s)=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>。若\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\Sigma_C^{\\mathcal M}(s)\">\\(\\eta\\in\\Sigma_C^{\\mathcal M}(s)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathsf{Prof}_{\\mathcal M}(s)\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathsf{Prof}_{\\mathcal M}(s)\\)</span>，写\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\preceq_{\\mathcal M,s}\\alpha\">\\(\\eta\\preceq_{\\mathcal M,s}\\alpha\\)</span> 表示</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta=\\alpha\\mathbin{|}_C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta=\\alpha\\mathbin{|}_C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{CGS}_{627}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{CGS}_{627}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{627}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}=S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}=(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}=S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}=(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket [C]A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\exists\\eta\\in\\Sigma_C^{\\mathcal M}(s)\\ \\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathsf{Prof}_{\\mathcal M}(s)\\\n(\\eta\\preceq_{\\mathcal M,s}\\alpha\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{out}(s,\\alpha)\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket [C]A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\exists\\eta\\in\\Sigma_C^{\\mathcal M}(s)\\ \\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathsf{Prof}_{\\mathcal M}(s)\\\n(\\eta\\preceq_{\\mathcal M,s}\\alpha\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{out}(s,\\alpha)\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{627}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{627}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{627}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{627}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(S,\\mathsf{Act},d,\\operatorname{out},V)\\in\\mathsf{CGS}_{627}\\ \\forall s\\in S\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{627}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{627}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{627}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(S,\\mathsf{Act},d,\\operatorname{out},V)\\in\\mathsf{CGS}_{627}\\ \\forall s\\in S\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{627}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{627}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>Coalition Logic 的目标差异是非正规、联盟索引的能力算子：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{627}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{M}^{627}\\)</span> 只表达目标集合单调性，而不误设正规模态 K；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{627}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{627}\\)</span> 连接空联盟与最大联盟，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sup}^{627}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sup}^{627}\\)</span> 表达不相交联盟能力的合成。第 9 节以单步并发行动剖面解释这些能力。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CL}_{627}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ag},\\mathsf{Coal},\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\operatorname{FV}_{627},\\operatorname{BV}_{627},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{627},\\operatorname{Sub}_{627},\\equiv_{\\alpha,627},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{627},\\mathsf{Rule}_{627},\\mathsf{Proof}_{627},\\operatorname{last}_{627},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{627},\\vdash_{627},\\mathsf{Thm}_{627},\n\\mathsf{CGS}_{627},\\mathsf{Prof},\\Sigma,\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{627},\\Vdash_{627},\\models_{627}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CL}_{627}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ag},\\mathsf{Coal},\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{627},\\operatorname{FV}_{627},\\operatorname{BV}_{627},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{627},\\operatorname{Sub}_{627},\\equiv_{\\alpha,627},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{627},\\mathsf{Rule}_{627},\\mathsf{Proof}_{627},\\operatorname{last}_{627},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{627},\\vdash_{627},\\mathsf{Thm}_{627},\n\\mathsf{CGS}_{627},\\mathsf{Prof},\\Sigma,\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{627},\\Vdash_{627},\\models_{627}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由联盟索引的能力公式、公理、规则、证明关系以及并发博弈语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>不在本条目中断言策略完备性、可判定性或模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-联盟博弈语义","text":"9. 联盟博弈语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\